#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example demonstrates the use of measured ride rate data to describe the suspension springs and anti-roll bars.
#
#In this case, bumpstops have been included in the spring data since everything was measured on the vehicle. The springs also have a mechanical ratio of 1 since the springs were installed on the vehicle during the test.
#
#On the Vehicle: Assembly screen, click on the Springs, Dampers, and Compliance datasets to see how the data is represented.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

